WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:01.553
- Hello.

00:00:01.553 --> 00:00:03.810
You guys are cute!

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.790
Walking out here with
your hats and your whole,

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.740
you are very cool, rock and roll country.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.573
I'm into it.

00:00:08.573 --> 00:00:09.510
- Oh my goodness, thank you.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.770
- And congratulations.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:11.603
- Thank you.

00:00:11.603 --> 00:00:13.590
- Yes, such an exciting time.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.730
Love is blooming.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.500
I heard that a dog introduced y'all.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.090
Is that, can I meet the dog?

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:20.070
Maybe it can help me.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.680
- It is actually the, like a funny story

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.252
'cause I was walking out of an audition

00:00:24.252 --> 00:00:27.210
on the Sunset Gala in Hollywood.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.550
And Billy's dog at the time, Tex,

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.610
who was the most beautiful
German shepherd you've ever seen.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:33.443
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:35.970
- He was tapped into some divine purpose

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.630
because we were, you know,
at the time just friends

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.900
and all these years later,
that was like 14 years ago.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.870
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.740
- So yeah, all these years
later we just got married.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.976
- I love dogs.

00:00:47.976 --> 00:00:48.930
(audience clapping)

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:49.780
They're the best.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.530
So wait, so I love your accent.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.760
I love Australia as well.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.990
Sorry, I'm focusing on her.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.790
I'm just like, just for a minute.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.950
No, I just, I love Australia so much.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.320
So what, what made you wanna move here?

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.280
- Honestly, Kelly, I had this
weird desire my whole life

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.370
that was like this burning
desire to come to America.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.292
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:09.292 --> 00:01:10.125
- I can't even explain where it came from

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.630
except pop music was like my spirituality.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.720
I just felt like this calling
when I listened to a song,

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.810
your songs, which I'm trying
to not completely freak out,

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:19.643
but like...

00:01:19.643 --> 00:01:21.540
- You are keeping it cool,
ma'am, yeah, you are totally.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.580
- You're one of my absolute idols.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.413
- Oh thanks.

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.520
- And listening to your music
growing up in Australia,

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:29.280
I just like literally felt this calling

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:32.399
that I just knew in my spirit
that I belonged in America.

00:01:32.399 --> 00:01:33.232
- It's a purpose.

00:01:33.232 --> 00:01:34.065
Yeah.

00:01:34.065 --> 00:01:37.890
- At 19 I just got on a
plane and never looked back.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:38.880
Like, yeah.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.170
- I did the same thing like 18.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.080
I drove and everyone was
like, what are you doing?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.490
But I drove from Texas to LA

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:46.050
and just lived on a mattress and worked.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.090
'Cause I knew, I was like,
this has gotta be it.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.140
There's no backup plan.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:49.973
I hope it works.

00:01:49.973 --> 00:01:50.806
- Literally.

00:01:50.806 --> 00:01:51.674
- Yeah.

00:01:51.674 --> 00:01:53.423
I was like, there's no backup plan.

